<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>mess of me, sexually</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">yustyna</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1rZo98sjxakhX5LCvp4OLE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.170" end="00:03.190">Baby, know exactly how I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.190" end="00:05.440">You know what I've got in this crisis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.440" end="00:09.200">Go make a mess of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.200" end="00:12.310">Sexually</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.310" end="00:15.390">Baby, know exactly how I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.390" end="00:17.810">You know what I've got in this crisis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.810" end="00:21.520">Go make a mess of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.520" end="00:24.200">Sexually</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.200" end="00:27.230">Run your mouth, run your mouth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.230" end="00:30.150">Said some things that pissed me off, then shout it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.150" end="00:33.400">Don't let me down (uh), tear me down (uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.400" end="00:36.220">Always kinda knew that you would let me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.220" end="00:39.530">'Cause, girl, you're magic, such a savage</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.530" end="00:42.650">The way you wipe me like I ain't somebody average</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.650" end="00:45.520">The way you cheatin' on your man, gon' do some damage</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.520" end="00:49.160">I should feel bad, I should feel bad, but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.160" end="00:52.200">Baby, know exactly how I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.200" end="00:54.990">You know what I've got in this crisis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.990" end="00:58.350">Go make a mess of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.350" end="01:01.580">Sexually (oh, fuck, we meet again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.580" end="01:04.600">Baby, know exactly how I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.600" end="01:07.250">You know what I've got in this crisis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.250" end="01:10.740">Go make a mess of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.740" end="01:13.440">Sexually</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.440" end="01:16.640">Was it dream? Was it nightmare?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.640" end="01:19.540">Was I hands around your girl? I fucked you right there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.540" end="01:22.680">And she liked that, I know she likes that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.680" end="01:25.740">Take a shot and do some blow, I fucked her like that, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.740" end="01:28.710">Carbon angel, fucked her halo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.710" end="01:31.870">The way I bend you over up against the table</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.870" end="01:34.820">The way you cheatin' on your man, don't have to say, though</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.820" end="01:38.620">I should feel bad, I should feel bad, but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.620" end="01:41.440">Baby, know exactly how I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.440" end="01:44.160">You know what I've got in this crisis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.160" end="01:47.770">Go make a mess of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.770" end="01:50.890">Sexually</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.890" end="01:53.780">Baby, know exactly how I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.780" end="01:56.520">You know what I've got in this crisis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.520" end="01:59.920">Go make a mess of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.920" end="02:02.470">Sexually</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.470" end="02:05.580" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.580" end="02:09.180">Mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.180" end="02:10.710">Mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.710" end="02:14.910">(M-m-mess) mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.910" end="02:16.410">Mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.060" end="02:20.060" /></div></body></tt>